# Copy the current token from .runtime/session.token into your HTTP client's
# private environment as `token`. Do not commit it. Server must be running.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Public health: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Missing token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system

### Wrong token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system
Authorization: Bearer invalid

### Protected metadata: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### OpenAPI: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/openapi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validate metadata, without creating or executing state: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"SCENARIO","id":"river-crossing"}

### Unsupported version: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"COMMAND","id":"order-1"}
